{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\" I have a favor to ask of you for today.\"","created_at":"2021-08-21T18:17:24.592000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878704358450155562","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"If its within my power... You will have it\"","created_at":"2021-08-21T18:17:45.018000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878704444123005018","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"I dont have my family here with me and Daidì has been gone for many years. You are the closest I have to a father and I see and respect you as one....Will you give me away today?\"","created_at":"2021-08-21T18:19:53.864000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878704984542310460","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"I would never give you away... as you are forever a part of me... but I will happily be your father for the day\"","created_at":"2021-08-21T18:20:58.946000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878705257515974703","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"You five are the legacy I leave behind.... just as a father would\"","created_at":"2021-08-21T18:21:47.148000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878705459689840740","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Thank you....thank for everything. I didn't really have a purpose until I met you. I will forever be grateful to have had you in my life. Never thought thought I would ever have a family again now I have a father and soon to be husband.  Thank you.\"","created_at":"2021-08-21T18:27:14.449000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878706832489721868","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"and siblings.... You are a Mender... a Mason... Ben will be here long after I am gone to help Roy and you all.... Look to those that set the 5 cornerstones, as you would a sibling....\" he pauses and stands up.  Even standing hes barely taller than Fuddles.  He leans over and kisses her on the forehead as a father would \"You are most welcome, Daughter Fuddles\"","created_at":"2021-08-21T18:29:26.177000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878707384997015572","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"Fuddles has tears in her eyes \"We will always stay close as a family thanks to you.\" She gets up and carefully gives him a hug.","created_at":"2021-08-21T18:32:28.037000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878708147773124688","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"He hugs back.  Its a warm hug, when its over he offers his elbow \"I have never been a father before.... so you may have to help me know what I need to do a bit\"","created_at":"2021-08-21T18:34:16.757000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878708603777851423","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
