{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"(yeah she's Wrong, rip)\nSabrine leaves a note,\n```Understandable. We didn't see him leave, and... I guess he didn't ask us to come with for a reason. I just hope the transformation wasn't painful - at least it sounded to me like he could just receive life energy from the ley lines, rather than having to die and be reborn. I... still remember the pain of that from the Ravens...\nThank you for being with him. I feel like I should have been there too, but I'm glad he wasn't alone. -Sab```\nbefore heading back out to the park.","created_at":"2021-08-23T05:53:37.101000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879241952917340210","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"So... nothing is wrong at the cottage. I just wanted to share with you more details about what happened with Gil yesterday\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T17:53:38.355000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879423152109797447","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
